[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0010","text":"那个……\n从车站出发第三个红绿灯左转的话"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0020","text":"应该快看到了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0030","text":"是几楼来着？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0040","text":"好像是地下演播室，\n但前台在一楼────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0050","text":"啊，那块招牌……是吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0060","text":"呼……呼……────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0070","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0080","text":"啊…………\n对不起──…………！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0090","text":"我、我才该说对不起……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0100","text":"真乃，没事吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0110","text":"嗯！\n只是撞到了一下包而已。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0120","text":"你在赶时间吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0130","text":"……啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0140","text":"……哇！　你看，那个……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0150","text":"呼……呼……\n……等等…………等等…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0160","text":"今天一定要，到那个地方…………去…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0170","text":"……啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0180","text":"不见了…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0190","text":"（啊，不见了……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0200","text":"（不过，应该勉强拍到了吧）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0210","text":"（……等等，现在不是停下来的时候）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0211","text":"街市的喧嚣"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0220","text":"──今天发售的手办，每人限购一个～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0230","text":"──要换手机吗～！\n现在还有抽奖……那边的小姐怎么样～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0240","text":"（吵死了。\n　不快点的话限定周边就要卖完了。）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0250","text":"──店铺活动进行中～！\n握手会的排队队尾在这里──！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0260","text":"（这次又是什么？　什么偶像不偶像的，\n　别挡路行不行……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0270","text":"（跟冬优没有关系────）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0271","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0280","text":"啊，小纱？\n看到了吗！？　刚才那个～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0290","text":"诶？　彩虹！\n超大的彩虹～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0300","text":"……没看到？　在卡拉OK？　骗人～～～～～～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0301","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0302","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0310","text":"……啊，我去趟便利店。\n你先走。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0320","text":"没关系的，我等你……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0330","text":"不用了。\n我在前面追上你。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0340","text":"那，圆香前辈\n草莓牛奶，帮我带一瓶～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0350","text":"我可没说要去帮你跑腿。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0360","text":"『──那个，我现在在便利店』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0370","text":"『透有什么想要的东西吗？』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0380","text":"嗯——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0390","text":"没有\n谢谢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0400","text":"……又是彩虹？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0410","text":"不是\n是泡泡"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0420","text":"你是从哪里来的\n你这家伙"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0421","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0422","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0430","text":"够不到啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0431","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0440","text":"──────………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0441","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0442","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0443","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0444","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0450","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_04010000_12_0460","text":"还是抓不住──────"}]
